; Trust anchors of the DNS root zone, from https://data.iana.org/root-anchors/root-anchors.xml
; KSK-2017 (20326) and KSK-2024 (38696), which signs the root zone since 2026-10-11.
; The copy in OpenWrt's unbound package lacks the second one, and DNSSEC validation,
; and with it every lookup, then fails as soon as the DNS server restarts.
. IN DS 20326 8 2 E06D44B80B8F1D39A95C0B0D7C65D08458E880409BBC683457104237C7F8EC8D
. IN DS 38696 8 2 683D2D0ACB8C9B712A1948B27F741219298D0A450D612C483AF444A4C0FB2B16
